abstract: "Bookkeeping for a therapy practice records insurance payments and self-pay sessions separately, grosses card payments back up before processor fees, books late-cancellation fees as revenue, pays contract clinicians their agreed share of what they collect, and keeps owner pay out of expenses. This kit has the chart of accounts, a checklist and a worked month."
